# Outputs

This directory is reserved for generated research outputs.

The notebook generates or references outputs including:

- dataset-distribution CSV files;
- train/validation/test split CSV files;
- model checkpoints;
- training-history plots;
- confusion matrices;
- ROC/AUC plots;
- classification reports;
- Grad-CAM visualizations;
- Vision Transformer attention visualizations;
- uncertainty outputs;
- out-of-distribution analysis;
- ablation CSV/XLSX files.

Examples of reviewer-oriented output names appearing in the notebook include:

- `Ablation_Results.csv`
- `Per_Class_F1.csv`
- `Ablation_Complete.xlsx`
- `R_Accuracy.png`
- `F1.png`
- `AUC.png`
- `Per_Class_F1.png`


